<title>JAPAN: Moody's says to raise Rohm's CB rating to A2.</title>
<headline>Moody's says to raise Rohm's CB rating to A2.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Thursday that it would raise its rating for Rohm Co Ltd's unsecured convertible bonds to A2 from Baa1.  </p>
<p>Moody's said that the rating change was based on its belief that Rohm's future profitability and debt protection measures would further benefit from the management's sharpened focus on advanced technologies and cost containment strategies.</p>
</text>
